{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15221020","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15221020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1522102001:1":{"text":"梅林女士，您还记得我吗？我、我是卡莉斯，小赛穆的妈妈。","source_cn":"梅林女士，您还记得我吗？我、我是卡莉斯，小赛穆的妈妈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9BC21530FAB94BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522102002:0":{"text":"上次小赛穆高烧不退，是您出手救了他，治好了他的病……","source_cn":"上次小赛穆高烧不退，是您出手救了他，治好了他的病……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x640F5C02F36D1F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522102003:0":{"text":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","source_cn":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F179988B24E275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1522102003":{"text":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","source_cn":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F179988B24E275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522102004:0":{"text":"小赛穆……我记得他。\n那可怜的、依偎在你怀中的男孩。","source_cn":"小赛穆……我记得他。\\n那可怜的、依偎在你怀中的男孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C268E5A588589AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}